# Future Work

Items intentionally out of scope for MVP. Revisit once the core bot is stable.

## Telegram Transport
- [ ] Webhooks instead of long polling (requires HTTPS endpoint)
- [ ] Caddy or nginx reverse proxy + Let's Encrypt TLS

## Voting Systems
- [ ] Approval voting
- [ ] Ranked-choice / IRV
- [ ] STAR voting
- [ ] Condorcet methods
- [ ] Majority judgment
- [ ] Quadratic voting
- [ ] Simple plurality

## Poll Features
- [ ] Multiple simultaneous polls per group chat
- [ ] Hidden results until poll closes (configurable)
- [ ] Per-poll visibility of individual votes (opt-in by creator)
- [ ] Poll scheduling (open/close at a specific time)
- [ ] Poll expiry / auto-close
- [ ] Result export (CSV or similar)
- [ ] Configurable score labels (e.g. 1=Poor, 5=Excellent)
- [ ] Abstain option per option (currently all options must be scored)
- [ ] Incomplete ballot partial submission

## Admin & Moderation
- [ ] Restrict poll creation to group admins only (opt-in)
- [ ] Global admin commands
- [ ] Audit log / ballot history export

## Infrastructure
- [ ] Web dashboard for poll management
- [ ] Public HTTP API
- [ ] User accounts outside Telegram
- [ ] Multi-language / i18n support
- [ ] Cryptographic ballot anonymity (e.g. blind signatures)

## Reliability
- [ ] Graceful handling of deleted original poll message
- [ ] Message edit rate-limit debouncing (if needed at scale)
- [ ] Health check endpoint for container orchestration
